## 6️⃣ Secure Configuration

| Setting | Recommended value | How to enforce |
|---------|-------------------|----------------|
| **`process.env.NODE_ENV`** | `'production'` in prod | `export NODE_ENV=production` |
| **`trust proxy`** (if behind a reverse proxy) | `true` only when you control the proxy | `app.set('trust proxy', 1);` |
| **`Content‑Security‑Policy`** (via Helmet) | Restrict script sources, `default-src 'self'` | `helmet.contentSecurityPolicy({ directives: { defaultSrc: ["'self'"] } })` |
| **TLS/HTTPS** | Enforce via reverse proxy (NGINX, Traefik) or `https.createServer` | Not in code, but part of deployment |

